<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Return and Refund Policy — GoCommerce BD</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Return and Refund Policy for subscriptions, billing, and merchant store sales on GoCommerce BD." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="/assets/css/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="/assets/css/marketing.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    .legal-page {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      color: #1e293b;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .legal-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .legal-card h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .legal-updated {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .legal-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .legal-card p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .legal-card ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      list-style-type: disc;
    }
    .legal-card li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .back-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #155dfc;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .back-btn:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="background:#f8fafc;min-height:100vh;">
  <header class="site-header" style="background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;">
    <div class="layout header-inner" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 24px;">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/logo.png" alt="GoCommerce BD" style="height:40px;max-width:240px;width:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain;" /></a>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-white" style="font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;">Home</a>
        <a href="/create-store" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;">Create Store</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-page">
    <a href="/" class="back-btn"><i class="ri-arrow-left-line"></i> Back to Home</a>
    <div class="legal-card">
      <h1>Return and Refund Policy</h1>
      <div class="legal-updated">Last Updated: October 2026 • Effective Immediately</div>

      <p>Thank you for choosing GoCommerce BD. We strive to provide transparent billing and dependable service across our SaaS eCommerce platform.</p>

      <h2>1. Platform Subscription Free Trial & Cancellation</h2>
      <p>GoCommerce BD offers a free trial for all plans so merchants can explore features before committing financially. You can cancel your paid subscription plan at any time through your merchant dashboard. Once cancelled, your plan remains active until the end of your prepaid billing period.</p>

      <h2>2. Subscription Refunds</h2>
      <p>If you experience technical issues or are dissatisfied with your paid subscription within <strong>7 days</strong> of your initial billing, please contact our support team. We will review your account activity and, where eligible, issue a refund to your original payment method (bKash, Nagad, card, or bank transfer).</p>

      <h2>3. Merchant Store Sales & Consumer Returns</h2>
      <p>Each independent merchant store built using GoCommerce BD operates its own customer return, replacement, and refund policies for the physical or digital products they sell. Buyers should refer directly to the return terms specified on the merchant's storefront.</p>

      <h2>4. Defective or Damaged Courier Deliveries</h2>
      <p>For courier-delivered orders, returns and damage claims are processed according to the delivery verification procedures of the selected courier partner (e.g. Steadfast, Pathao, RedX). Merchants can track return parcels and status updates directly in the courier management tab.</p>

      <h2>5. How to Request a Refund or Support</h2>
      <p>To request assistance with billing or refunds, please reach out to our billing support:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> support@gocommerce.bd</li>
        <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +880 1969 909069</li>
        <li><strong>Office:</strong> Level 8, Rangs Babylonia, 246 Bir Uttam Mir Shawkat Sarak, Dhaka 1208, Bangladesh</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
